## What's in this directory

```
{{ run_slug }}/
├── notebook.ipynb         # walks through using the planner end-to-end on a smoke problem
├── method/                # importable Python package
│   ├── __init__.py        # public API
│   ├── method.py          # the paper's contribution (the planner)
